### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### 로그인, 맞는 비밀번호 및 계정
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### 로그인, 틀린 비밀번호로
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "asdf"
}

### 일정 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "제목이다33",
  "content": "내용이다33"
}

### 일정 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/schedule?page=1&size=10

### 일정 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/schedule/3

### 일정 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/schedule/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "제목이다ㅇㅇㅇㅇㅇㅇ",
  "content": "내용이다ㅇㅇㅇㅇㅇㅇ"
}

### 일정 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/schedule/6

### 댓글 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/3/comment
Content-Type:application/json

{
  "content": "댓글글글 댓글글글 댓글글글"
}

### 댓글 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/3/comments

### 댓글 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/comment/3

### 댓글 수정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/comment/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "댓글 수정수정수정"
}

### 댓글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/comment/1

### 대댓글 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/comment/2/reply
Content-Type:application/json

{
  "content": "대대대대대댓글글글글"
}